  "notes": "This is a supplement (rev 01) to the original LER; docket 05000373 corresponds to LaSalle Unit 1, though the affected offsite-power consequence was for Unit 2 Division 2 bus 242Y via the cross-tie breaker ACB 1424. Unit anchor set to Unit 1 per docket/component ownership (ACB 1422 is a Unit 1 SAT feed breaker); Unit 2 impact captured in consequence text. No BACKED_UP_BY edges asserted since narrative does not state an alternate operable offsite source was available during the inoperability window; instead it describes LCO required actions not taken."
